WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:05.867
Items and stock

00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:13.280
Open Inventory in the sidebar and choose Items. Each item shows its stock, price and a status.

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:22.988
Open Categories and add one. Vendors work the same way.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:43.883
Press Add Item. Enter the name, choose the category and unit, and set the current stock, the minimum stock and the price.

00:01:09.568 --> 00:01:13.527
Press Create. The item appears in the list.

00:01:15.047 --> 00:01:21.540
Use Stock Status to see only items that are Low Stock or Out of Stock, so you know what to reorder.

00:01:23.469 --> 00:01:30.683
Press AI Suggest and choose a kind of school, such as Science Lab. Tick the items you want and add them in one go.

00:01:34.577 --> 00:01:39.462
Stock under control
